  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nhey,\n\nI have a question about the parser rules. A minor thing that I might be misunderstanding. In the rules for the [The \"initial\" insertion mode](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/parsing.html#the-initial-insertion-mode). The first sentence is\n\n_A [Document](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/dom.html#document) object has an associated parser cannot change the mode flag (a boolean). It is initially false._\n\nis this meant to be \n\n_A [Document](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/dom.html#document) object has an associated parser **that** cannot change the mode flag (a boolean). It is initially false._\n\nor something else ?",
